{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1000_032emi", "source_sha256": "8415b826bc1e82ce2bd7ff0dccc133e2d7dab9fdf82da84ffda187c275109456", "ja": "私、最初の曲で立ち位置を間違えてしまって。\n頭が真っ白になってしまって……。", "zh": "我在第一首曲子的时候站错位置了。\n脑子里一片空白……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "e1c7d5f0c2ab6de0cc3ac7f3761d5273c55945fe7baa48a49405f2895e6a68f4", "ja": "その後の進行も、翼さんや伊織さまが\nいらっしゃらなければ、どうなっていたことか……。", "zh": "之后的流程，要不是有翼小姐和伊织大人在，我真不知道会变成什么样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "aeba9440dab2daf85244483214807ee90cb1295fbe197c3ff1667c30b275f49a", "ja": "そんなに気にしなくても大丈夫だよ、エミリーちゃん。\nちゃんとカバーできてたし……。", "zh": "不用那么在意，艾米莉。我们已经好好弥补上了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "955f67b47ecaddb25ad5c9f1f101fc5acb55606b8849eabc6f79cff62c968707", "ja": "そうだよ、エミリーちゃん！　心配しなくても大丈夫。\nお客さんたち、すっごく楽しんでたから！", "zh": "没错，艾米莉！不用担心，没事的。\n客人们都玩得特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "5765fa8f50b78d13ba91bce53b8bdc3e53ceb79ddfbd4e194d7711ec85851af8", "ja": "ありがとうございます。……でも、あの時もし、\n私のせいで公演が止まってしまっていたらと思うと……", "zh": "谢谢大家。……可是，只要一想到万一在那个时候，\n公演因为我而被迫中止的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "d76b5a25ba2522fdff096dd101534ac60b51835cf900099db7e18f51acac4338", "ja": "私はまだまだ、修行が足りないようです……。", "zh": "看来我的修行还远远不够……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "00c10cfc108ee0d635eb1af63677c1296ba0e2548933981eb7d96027677e4b9d", "ja": "エミリーちゃん……。", "zh": "艾米莉……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1007_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1008_p", "source_sha256": "19b6597413ae911a04127e26a5b6dca802ee8e542497922e4a6b859b3bb5fc33", "ja": "お疲れ様。\n育とやよい、帰ってきたぞ。", "zh": "辛苦了。\n育和弥生回来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "90928cb31247a540e92402f5987957d6d1a47641ae98fc96afc8600faefc07f1", "ja": "ただいまー！\nみんな、お待たせしました！", "zh": "我回来啦——！\n让大家久等了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "db849fba8447c6b70af99daec59d97d5758d21bd09c6bc1a4410771f04cfb56a", "ja": "お疲れさまです！\n撮影、無事に終わりましたよー。えへへ♪", "zh": "辛苦了！\n拍摄顺利结束啦。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2d2f56de5c85af9af6da22d76dba3255097a9fee25d054a52b21c7f19afc55f4", "ja": "これで全員だな。それじゃ早速だけど、\nミーティングを始めるぞ。", "zh": "这样人就齐了。那我们马上开始开会吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c234af291a6f15539ec853cf6ac7efa21048b8a8359d88c477db2ab8f20548c1", "ja": "実は今度、この5人で\nTVに出演することになったんだ。", "zh": "其实下次，要由你们这5个人\n一起上电视节目了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "ba33249c4b94ac95a8fa27895e36abca2198a4a3104835346e748f1138c4e78e", "ja": "えっ、私たち5人で……？\n{$P$}、どんな番組なんですか？", "zh": "咦，我们5个人……？\n{$P$}，是什么样的节目？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1014_p", "source_sha256": "449d2347f435c020a67e43b510df1dcdae20f768095c5c6b4cedef4b90b13148", "ja": "やよいが出演してる『中学生ダイアリー』の\n小学生版で、『小学生デイズ！』という番組だ。", "zh": "是弥生出演的《中学生日记》的\n小学生版，叫做《小学生Days！》。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1015_p", "source_sha256": "1fa66f9ff8d94b95e99ae28d0fcb3e55ae2eecb3cfce4ce5c70b0a9598f53085", "ja": "レギュラー出演者は全員小学生で、世の中の色んな事を\n勉強する。育もこの前、ゲスト出演したんだよな。", "zh": "常规出演者全都是小学生，学习社会上的各种事情。育之前也作为嘉宾出演过，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "8cbe3ad466d431eac1d1bf8a7152c55c389e23bdbed52092ae869e5cbcdf65e3", "ja": "うん！　わたしは、動物園のしいく員さんの\nお仕事を勉強する回だったよ。すっごく楽しかった！", "zh": "嗯！我参加的那一期是学习动物园饲养员工作的。特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "6b9448acbc42ef229fbb0fdcf1938a1a726690c04c871db73c0d3cac08eb81e1", "ja": "私も、家で妹や弟たちと見てます。\nいろんな内容があって、楽しいですよー。", "zh": "我也会和弟弟妹妹们在家里一起看。内容丰富多彩，很有意思哦——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ad23ea52bb868b35176e4b41dd6b914f433441d4579553aad23663c36f42279e", "ja": "小学生向けの……。あの、私、浮かないですか？\n年齢的にも、みんなより離れちゃってますし……。", "zh": "面向小学生的话……那个，我不会显得格格不入吗？\n毕竟在年龄上，我和大家也差得蛮多的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1019_p", "source_sha256": "1aa92f3497a60d5d66fb4a1fa639ff15d23cfa6311ac27be2e27fa55acfd6710", "ja": "それについては大丈夫だ。今回の5人は、\nアイドルの仕事を教える先生としての出演なんだ。", "zh": "关于那一点不用担心。这次的5人，是以教大家偶像工作相关知识的老师身份出演的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1020_p", "source_sha256": "8b1b54d52467ac2b2f4e5e7439dcd5501d96b534b20a8c2876fad7314bf4e910", "ja": "みんなにスタジオで子ども達と話をしてもらう他は、\n公演の様子をVTR映像で流してもらう事になってる。", "zh": "除了让大家在演播室里和孩子们聊天之外，\n还打算播放演出的录像片段。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1021_027say", "source_sha256": "008a0820ae71bdf3694471df66dac8c26b1917e89fd490c3c338c7f370ad878a", "ja": "なるほど、アイドルの先生……わかりました！\n私に教えてあげられることなら、がんばります！", "zh": "原来如此，是要当偶像的老师……明白了！\n只要是我能教给大家的，我会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1022_p", "source_sha256": "d64dd25d00b4c60e5ee5ff2f075b7ee90b16adc808ab9b059802736a08db77fc", "ja": "よろしくな！　それから、もうひとつ……\n次の定期公演も、この5人でいこうと思うんだ。", "zh": "那就拜托你了！还有就是，另外一件事……\n下一次的定期演出，我也打算让你们5个人上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1023_p", "source_sha256": "15c27395df99c8f2d2615e4147e0bfbcac448451611dcb8f7830824f2b94492e", "ja": "ちょうど、番組が放送される頃だからな。そこで\nエミリーに新曲のお披露目をしてもらおうと思ってる。", "zh": "正好，节目也要在那段时间播出。所以我想让艾米莉在那里首次公开演唱新歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1024_032emi", "source_sha256": "c461a5ad8009644b5c92465d448dece6d2e8e54b5cfcd395651e5a9350437003", "ja": "えっ！？\nわ、私の新曲ですか……！？", "zh": "诶！？\n我、我的新歌吗……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1025_030iku", "source_sha256": "f20391266c4ed8ace0f54eac43e685b71c43d18bce9444cc657fb1f92f12fb6e", "ja": "エミリーさん、やったね！\n新曲だって！", "zh": "艾米莉，太好了！\n听说是新歌哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1026_005yay", "source_sha256": "30c306e63575df0cede26e7838d19f437ee38d87a66265bb2f122a22cb18a217", "ja": "私もこの前新曲歌ったけど、すーっごく楽しかったよ！\nエミリーちゃんの曲、楽しみだね♪", "zh": "我前阵子也唱了新歌，特别特别开心！好期待艾米莉的歌呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1027_032emi", "source_sha256": "284396b281ac22b30588bee1ec63c757d1d635b0ab3e98ddf40108f672dd85e2", "ja": "は、はい……。\n……。", "zh": "是、是的……\n……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1028_027say", "source_sha256": "d2701fba603d19d19749daf1d858b104dfd87b9e097fd56bb37cc93cb5bbb3f0", "ja": "エミリーちゃん……大丈夫！　心配しなくても、\n私たちが、しっかりサポートするから！", "zh": "艾米莉……没事的！你不用担心，\n我们会好好支持你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1029_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b90e65d44edc53a6ab53f9accf0de5747a80aea78196f52bf769f3f2119c4453", "ja": "うん。いろんな準備があって大変かもしれないけど、\nみんなでがんばろうね！", "zh": "嗯。准备工作可能有很多，会很辛苦，但我们一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1030_032emi", "source_sha256": "bd87b9d46368d41347938f051c25addb8fb7a6265fe9beb4a9d2cf4ace2c07f2", "ja": "紗代子さん、風花さん………ありがとうございます。\n私、が、がんばります……！", "zh": "纱代子小姐、风花小姐……谢谢你们。我、我会努力的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1031_p", "source_sha256": "4c927aba16970bd623a09f277ae08466f78b857f2e6820c9bc057da6fc48ca39", "ja": "（エミリー、少し元気がないみたいだな。\nもしかして……）", "zh": "（艾米莉好像有点没精神。\n难道是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1032_null", "source_sha256": "4e03628f0d9a16687cb40235d9027027e0946b42d296ffebaf281912d51b724c", "ja": "ミーティング終了後……", "zh": "会议结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1033_p", "source_sha256": "0ef4c35661d9a848507e118c097b9137fd85d562ec0f56bd95af4f04591ac0e8", "ja": "エミリー、ちょっといいか？", "zh": "艾蜜莉，你现在有空吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1034_032emi", "source_sha256": "b8994e6efa1e7e2f876e00e5c06e0ee5d404fda5df2db47cddfb296bedf34a08", "ja": "あっ……し、仕掛け人さま。\nあの、何か……？", "zh": "啊……制、制作人先生。\n那个，请问有什么事吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1035_p", "source_sha256": "817ae94573cad2df67446b2dafde61b5159f65f23ffb265bf0aea7b039b57bd9", "ja": "ミーティングの時から、ずっと元気がないけど……\nもしかして、この前のミスを気にしているのか？", "zh": "从会议开始就一直没什么精神……\n难道还在介意前几天的失误吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1036_032emi", "source_sha256": "b55241f339bba9cab50cf14bac79f7f60ffe28b959e38dc3b67d8661b83b32a5", "ja": "はい……。私が未熟なせいで、劇場の外での\nお仕事が、危うく台無しになるところでした。", "zh": "是的……都怪我还不够成熟，差点让剧场外的工作功亏一篑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1037_032emi", "source_sha256": "5b11cb0969d455c50c3b73f601463fe36d41b25c0d886bea39a04290b0ed119b", "ja": "あの時、私が焦らずに気持ちを切り替えていれば、\nみなさんに迷惑をかけることもなかったのに……。", "zh": "要是那时我没有着急，调整好心态的话，\n就不会给大家添麻烦了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1038_p", "source_sha256": "a81e2a968792a9e8318fe70883221562c5181c7cc4c03af1f3446abbd73fd4d2", "ja": "そうか。でも、いい方向で\n反省できているみたいで、安心したよ。", "zh": "这样啊。不过，看起来你能往好的方向反省，我也就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1039_032emi", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1040_p", "source_sha256": "a966c3b11a5a6b70bef83c04a49e3ed8851b19844df8b6dbc57bc2a8df3f081f", "ja": "練習をするのは、本番でミスをしないためだ。けど、\nどんなに練習しても起きてしまうのが、ミスだからな。", "zh": "练习是为了不在正式演出时出错。不过，不管怎么练习，还是会发生的就是失误。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1041_p", "source_sha256": "49bb5f8562f11360724ed26f32e582745cd26a79f9748f544487a38f02604292", "ja": "ミスをしても焦らない事が大事だと気づいたなら、\n次に活かせばいい。だから大丈夫だ。", "zh": "意识到就算犯错也不要慌张很重要的话，之后吸取教训就好。所以没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1042_032emi", "source_sha256": "802f6ba1c6afef528483fc53f5c672253dcd175dc0ca45581de5cf039ddfd0f7", "ja": "仕掛け人さま……。", "zh": "策划执行人先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1043_p", "source_sha256": "32e2d9756b9c4c7f8180bb0702fcfc93c9aac08b91f020b8ebf97da70de6ce3d", "ja": "みんなそうやって、失敗を繰り返して、\n上手になってきたんだしな。", "zh": "大家都是这样不断重复失败，才逐渐变得熟练的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1044_p", "source_sha256": "6e7ced8a74be8d9bb01f09c35c29e4bc0e9595cdf3f175e0375bb1cbc619bdcd", "ja": "この後は、撮影にレッスンにと忙しくなるからな。\n気持ちを引き締めて、頑張っていこう！", "zh": "接下来又要拍摄，又要上课，会忙起来的。打起精神，一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1045_032emi", "source_sha256": "b848057ef1a4fce880e7107c517dd8b9ad03222bd316eed0cc0f826fb9013ef1", "ja": "気持ちを引き締めて……そうですね。\n私が、足を引っ張るわけには……。", "zh": "打起精神……是啊。\n我不能拖后腿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1046_032emi", "source_sha256": "376e6295ef1a5791fa5b6ad058e939ce4953280bee544466680d042d911ce58f", "ja": "わかりました、仕掛け人さま！\n私……が、がんばります！", "zh": "明白了，制作人大人！\n我……会、会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1047_032emi", "source_sha256": "35116ecc4816c0131b26b50f263586f718dfe2fdbc61b8f583bac4d155ea0bb2", "ja": "そして、小学生のみなさんに、大和撫子の素晴らしさを\n伝えるお役目を、しっかりと果たしてみせます……！", "zh": "而且，我一定会好好完成向小学生们传达大和抚子的美好这一使命……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1048_p", "source_sha256": "99404465fdb7d54f07a6ff97e8e6c918acf7f0186b09e1cb18ae67afb2204569", "ja": "ああ。よろしく頼む。", "zh": "啊。那就拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1049_032emi", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1050_p", "source_sha256": "7e81d07c99540cb2d664236358ffc069693a814c194892bc1bdc921a9d90334a", "ja": "（エミリー、まだ少し無理をしているかな……。\n根が真面目だから、気に病んでしまうんだろう）", "zh": "（艾米莉，还是有点勉强自己吗……\n她本性认真，所以才会这么过于在意吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_101_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_101_1051_p", "source_sha256": "63e3cfd04b75a2aad02c5a65ea23084c1ade197c74b143e5ea44ba901a5a90ee", "ja": "（あまり落ち込みすぎないといいんだけど）", "zh": "（希望她不要太过消沉就好了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
